docs {
  Scenario: Roles can be listed and looked up by id

    When the full role list is fetched
    And a role is looked up by id

  The roles endpoint binds no query parameters, so a role can only be found
  by walking the full list. The by id action returns an array rather than a
  single object; this scenario asserts that shape as it is. The scenario is
  read only and needs no cleanup.
}
